-*   `_features_dc`: `Tensor(N, 1, 3)`, float32. 0th-degree SH coefficients (colors).
-*   `_scaling`: `Tensor(N, 3)`, float32. Log-scales.
-*   `_rotation`: `Tensor(N, 4)`, float32. Raw quaternions.
-*   `_opacity`: `Tensor(N, 1)`, float32. Log-odds.
